      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_futures_price = 865.0\n    roll_short_term_price = 877.0\n    roll_long_term_price = 883.0\n    collateral_annual_rate = 0.006\n    holding_period_years = 3 / 12\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    futures_price_return = (\n        (roll_short_term_price - initial_futures_price)\n        / initial_futures_price\n    )\n    roll_return = (\n        (roll_short_term_price - roll_long_term_price)\n        / roll_short_term_price\n    )\n    collateral_return = collateral_annual_rate * holding_period_years\n\n    total_return = (\n        futures_price_return\n        + roll_return\n        + collateral_return\n    ) * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(total_return, 3)\n```",
